<p>Tadapna wo akber ka keh keh ke paani<br />
Jhijhakti qaza aur ubharti jawaani</p>

<p>Sirhaane pisar ke pidar sun raha hai<br />
Har hichki ki aawaaz me pani pani</p>

<p>Na zainab ki dhaaras na maa ka sahara<br />
bhare ghar se rukhsat hui hai jawani</p>

<p>Qayamat hai ab inqelaabe zamana<br />
Zaeefi ke haato pa uth'ti jawaani</p>

<p>Jab asghar humakte hai haato pa sheh ke<br />
ubal ta hai darya chalakta hai paani</p>

<p>Ubalte hai abbas ke ran me aansu<br />
tapakta hai mashke sakina se paani</p>

<p>Lute dono aashoor ko karbala me <br />
Nabi ka alam aur ali ki nashaani</p>

<p>Hai ab jalte qaimo me majboor abid<br />
bohot paas shole bohot door pani</p>

<p>wo darbaare hakim wo laakho ka majma<br />
Wo bhai ka qissa behen ki zabani</p>

<p>Meri god me aake baitho sakina<br />
sunaau mai bhayya ki tumko kahani</p>

<p>Rahe neel baazu e zainab pa baaqi<br />
watan ko gayi karbala ki nashaani<br />
</p>